Hi ,

I'm Madhur, Co-founder and CEO at Printrove. I genuinely get excited
every time someone new joins because I know what's possible from here!

Here's what I'd love for you to do next: order one sample. Pick any
product, throw your logo or any design on it, and order a single
piece. When it shows up at your door with your branding on it,
something shifts. It stops being "maybe I'll sell merch" and becomes
"oh, I'm actually doing this."

Takes about 2 minutes: https://merchants.printrove.com

No minimums. No subscription. Just one piece, for you.

I'm curious, what's the idea behind your brand? What are you building? 😊

Madhur
Printrove


